ddak Elfayrouz (Gardening Website)\r\n•	Website: Haddak Elfayrouz\r\n•	Description: Developed a Laravel-based website offering gardening services to users.\r\n10.	Yousab Tech Website (Software Company)\r\n•	Website: Yousab Tech\r\n•	Description: Established a freelance software company website showcasing web and mobile development services.\r\n11.	Dashboard\r\n•	Website: Dashboard\r\n•	Credentials:\r\n•	Username: admin@gmail.com\r\n•	Password: 123456789\r\n•	Description: Created a dashboard for controlling content on the software company website.\n\nMedical Sources\nhttp://medical-sources.demoyoursite.net/ar/home \n\nOxford training\nhttps://oxford.demoyoursite.net/ar \n\nSeventh Station\nhttps://demoyoursite.net/boula/seventh-station/public/ar   \n   \nHealthcare web application\nhttps://myrx-eg.com \n\nE-learning System\nhttps://github.com/kirolosKhamis/e-learning4kids \n\r\n\r\nCertifications\r\nEducation and Training\r\n•	Graduate of Youth Enablement Initiative\r\nNov 2020 - Jan 2021\r\nMinistry of Communication and Information Technology\r\nStudied Web Development.\r\n•	Graduate of African App Launchpad (AAL)\r\nJun 2020 - Oct 2020\r\nMinistry of Communication and Information Technology\r\nSpecialized in Web Design and Web Application Development.\r\n•	Graduate of Next Technology Leaders (NTL)\r\nJul 2019 - Oct 2019\r\nMinistry of Communication and Information Technology\r\nFocused on Graphic Design Specialization.\r\nProfessional Experience\r\n•	Back-End Developer Intern\r\nSystel\r\nAug 2019 - Sep 2019\r\nUtilized SQL and MySQL databases.\r\nProficient in HTML, CSS, PHP, and JavaScript.\r\nCollaborated with local and remote teams to optimize product implementation.\r\nAdditional Training and Certifications\r\n•	Information Technology (IT) Course\r\nAmerican University in Cairo (AUC)\r\n•	TOEFL iBT Exam\r\nAMIDEAST\r\n•	IELTS Exam\r\nBritish Council\r\n\r\n•	Founder, Yousab Tech\r\nEstablished an IT solutions company.\r\n•	Founder, Myrx\r\nFounded a medical care company.\r\n•	Web Developer, 4Web Student Activity Initiative\r\nContributed to web development projects.\r\n•	Graphic Designer, Talentk Team\r\nDesigned graphics for various projects and initiatives.\r\n•	Marketing Committee Member, AASTMT Conference\r\nParticipated in marketing efforts for a conference at AASTMT.\r\n•	Team Leader, Design Committee, Lit-Up Team\r\nLed a design committee within the Lit-Up team.\r\n•	Former Trainee, Entrepreneur\r\nParticipated in training activities focused on entrepreneurship.\r\n\r\nScholarships\r\nAwards & Certificates\r\n•	Certificate of Completion: HEI Private University Scholarship\r\n2016 - 2021\r\nRecipient of the Local Scholarship Program (LSP).\r\n•	Leadership in Action Program Completion Letter\r\n2021\r\nSuccessfully completed the Leadership in Action Program.\r\n•	IIE Award of the Academic Year\r\n2018 - 2019\r\nRecognized for outstanding academic achievement.\r\n	\r\nLanguages\r\n•	Arabic: Native\r\n•	English: B2 proficiency\r\n\r\nAchievements and Awards \r\n•	First Position Winner in Rally Competition\r\nJul 2022\r\nAwarded for developing the best web application to address social problems.\r\nEducation and Training\r\n•	Bachelor\'s Degree in Computer Science\r\nArab Academy for Science, Technology & Maritime Transport (AAST), Alexandria\r\nNov 2016 - Jul 2021\r\nReceived through the Higher Education for Private Universities program managed by the Institute of International Education and funded by USAID.\r\n•	Youth Enablement Initiative\r\nMinistry of Communication and Information Technology\r\nNov 2020 - Jan 2021\r\nStudied Web Development.\r\n•	African App Launchpad (AAL)\r\nMinistry of Communication and Information Technology\r\nOct 2020\r\nGraduated in Web Design and Web Application Development.\r\n•	Next Technology Leaders (NTL)\r\nMinistry of Communication and Information Technology\r\nOct 2019\r\nGraduated with a specialization in Graphic Design.\r\n\r\n\r\nNotes\r\nDo not write your job roles in experience \r\n\r\n\r\nWhat makes you the ideal candidate for this position?\r\nMy skills set is a perfect match for the job requirements. In particular, my technical skills and experience make me an ideal candidate for the position. For example, at my current job, I managed to create many web applications for the company clients and all of them got excellent feedback. Also, I used to work under pressure and catch deadlines. Additionally, I really care about clean code and security. So, I think I am a good fit for this position.\r\n\r\nWhat’s a challenging situation you experienced while working on a project? How did you deal with it? What did you learn?\r\nActually, I am working as a Laravel Developer in a company called Marwan Tech and the challenging situation that I faced was to integrate a payment gateway to the company website. The Payment gateway  documentation was very complicated and incomplete, since they missed some important points such as their payment API depends on two different servers and I needed to hold on for 10 seconds  after submitting the request and I managed to configure that by tracking the request. Finally, I succeeded.\r\n\r\nWhat is your best technical skill? Elaborate, on all skills, in details please\r\nI have many technical skills that relate to this position and also that relate to Software development in general, I will start with those that relate to the position. I am proficient in basic web development technologies such as HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, Javascript and PHP. I am also experienced in frameworks such as Laravel and Angular. For Databases I am a professional in SQL. For technologies that do not relate to the position I can create mobile and desktop applications.\r\n\r\nDescribe your current job responsibilities\r\n\r\nMy current position is a Backend Laravel Developer and my responsibilities are to create dashboards for web applications, and also to prepare all the APIs needed by the frontend Developer. Additionally, I am responsible for adding web services to the website such as payment gateways. Moreover, I work on testing the website\'s scalability and ability to work under large loads made by too many requests and big large data. Finally, I create a database schema that suits the website requirements.','2025-04-17 19:25:26','2025-07-13 05:58:06',1,0,1),(77,'Shaving Refrence','','When shaving use detol and cover all your beard and use straight determining method to easily avoid mistakes','2025-04-21 01:03:05','2025-07-13 05:58:06',1,0,1),(78,'Routine Tasks Videos','','Backend Tasks\r\n1-none translatable modules ***done***\r\n2- translatable modules ***done***\r\n3-how to modifi module inputs ***done***\r\n4- how to link modules with eachothets\r\n5- Morph files (single & multible) ***done***\r\n6- translate a website using workspace\r\n7- how to produce api as get and post requests ***done***\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFrontend Tasks\r\nReact\r\n1- translate a website usin t() ***done***\r\n2- file with component + api link + response + payload and using chatgpt to dynamic it get or post ***done***\r\nLaravel \r\n1- reutrn data to a static blade  \r\n2- translations in laravel ***done***\r\n3- github recabe \r\n\r\n\r\nWorkspace features\r\n\r\n1-Database features ***done***\r\n2-Translations \r\n3-Creating new modules\r\n4- dealing with tasks system\r\n\r\nNone videos tasks\r\n1- testing dashboard modules and giving report errors\r\n2- content mangement\r\n3-Designing a temblate \r\n4-Creating a wordpress website\r\n\r\nNote: in case oc employment they can do all of theses tasks together','2025-04-21 16:40:36','2025-07-13 05:58:06',1,0,1),(79,'Payments Client Comparison','','أفضل بوابات الدفع لمتاجر المنتجات في مصر:\r\n\r\n1. Paymob\r\n\r\nمناسب جدًا لـ E-commerce.\r\n\r\nبيدعم:\r\n\r\nفيزا وماستركارد.\r\n\r\nMeeza.\r\n\r\nمحافظ إلكترونية (زي Vodafone Cash، Orange Money...).\r\n\r\nفوري.\r\n\r\nالدفع بالتقسيط (مثل ValU، Souhoola).\r\n\r\n\r\nسهل الربط بـ Laravel, React, WooCommerce, Shopify، وغيره.\r\n\r\nتقارير مفصلة، ولوحة تحكم سهلة.\r\n\r\n\r\n2. Accept Payments\r\n\r\nنفس مميزات Paymob تقريبًا.\r\n\r\nواجهة API قوية وسهلة الدمج.\r\n\r\nدعم فني محترم.\r\n\r\nبيقدموا حلول تقسيط بالتعاون مع شركات تمويل.\r\n\r\n\r\n3. Fawry\r\n\r\nمناسب لو عايز توفر الدفع نقدًا أو عبر فروع فوري.\r\n\r\nبيدعم كروت ومحافظ كمان.\r\n\r\nبيحتاج تكامل إضافي شوية عن Paymob وAccept.\r\n\r\n\r\n4. PayTabs\r\n\r\nلو بتفكر تبيع دوليًا كمان، PayTabs ممتاز.\r\n\r\nبيدعم بوابات دولية، لكن بيشتغل كويس في مصر كمان.\r\n*********************************************\r\n بوابات دفع خارج مصر \r\n\r\n1. PayTabs\r\n\r\nمناسبة لـ: مصر، السعودية، الإمارات، وعموم دول الخليج.\r\n\r\nطرق الدفع:\r\n\r\nبطاقات فيزا وماستركارد.\r\n\r\nالدفع بالتقسيط (مناسب لعملاء الخليج).\r\n\r\nالمحافظ الإلكترونية (مثل STC Pay، وApple Pay).\r\n\r\nخيارات متعددة في التقارير.\r\n\r\n\r\nالمميزات:\r\n\r\nدعم قوي للمبيعات الدولية.\r\n\r\nدعم شامل للمتاجر الإلكترونية.\r\n\r\nسهل الربط مع منصات مثل WooCommerce و Shopify.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n2. Telr\r\n\r\nمناسبة لـ: الإمارات، السعودية، مصر، البحرين.\r\n\r\nطرق الدفع:\r\n\r\nفيزا وماستركارد.\r\n\r\nباي بال.\r\n\r\nالدفع عند الاستلام.\r\n\r\nخدمة التقسيط.\r\n\r\n\r\nالمميزات:\r\n\r\nبوابة دفع سريعة وآمنة.\r\n\r\nخيارات واسعة في طرق الدفع.\r\n\r\nدعم التجارة الإلكترونية في منطقة الشرق الأوسط.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n3. Payfort (أمازون باي)\r\n\r\nمناسبة لـ: السعودية، الإمارات، مصر، البحرين.\r\n\r\nطرق الدفع:\r\n\r\nفيزا وماستركارد.\r\n\r\nالدفع من خلال بطاقات الائتمان/الخصم.\r\n\r\nالدفع بالتقسيط.\r\n\r\nالدفع عبر الهاتف المحمول (محافظ إلكترونية).\r\n\r\n\r\nالمميزات:\r\n\r\nخدمات متكاملة من أمازون.\r\n\r\nدعم فعال للتجارة الإلكترونية في المنطقة.\r\n\r\nتقارير مفصلة ومراقبة الأنشطة المالية.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n4. Fawry\r\n\r\nمناسبة لـ: مصر.\r\n\r\nطرق الدفع:\r\n\r\nفوري (دفع من خلال الفروع).\r\n\r\nبطاقات فيزا وماستركارد.\r\n\r\nالمحافظ الإلكترونية.\r\n\r\nالدفع عند الاستلام.\r\n\r\n\r\nالمميزات:\r\n\r\nحل مثالي للدفع في مصر عبر فروع فوري.\r\n\r\nيدعم الدفع بطرق متنوعة.\r\n\r\nمرن وسهل الربط مع مواقع التجارة الإلكترونية.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n5. CCAvenue\r\n\r\nمناسبة لـ: معظم الدول العربية.\r\n\r\nطرق الدفع:\r\n\r\nفيزا وماستركارد.\r\n\r\nباي بال.\r\n\r\nالمحافظ الإلكترونية.\r\n\r\n\r\nالمميزات:\r\n\r\nبوابة دفع متعددة الأنواع.\r\n\r\nتدعم أكثر من 200 طريقة دفع مختلفة في المنطقة.\r\n\r\nخيارات واسعة في العملة.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n6. Payoneer\r\n\r\nمناسبة لـ: السعودية، الإمارات، مصر، والعديد من الدول العربية.\r\n\r\nطرق الدفع:\r\n\r\nبطاقة ماستركارد المدفوعة مسبقًا.\r\n\r\nالتحويلات الدولية.\r\n\r\nدفع مقابل الخدمات.\r\n\r\n\r\nالمميزات:\r\n\r\nتعد من أشهر بوابات الدفع للمحترفين والشركات الدولية.\r\n\r\nمثالية لمن يبيعون دوليًا في منطقة الشرق الأوسط.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n7. 2Checkout (Verifone)\r\n\r\nمناسبة لـ: الإمارات، مصر، السعودية.\r\n\r\nطرق الدفع:\r\n\r\nبطاقات ائتمان.\r\n\r\nباي بال.\r\n\r\nطرق دفع محلية متعددة.\r\n\r\n\r\nالمميزات:\r\n\r\nيدعم مجموعة واسعة من الأسواق.\r\n\r\nآمن وسهل الربط.\r\n\r\nمناسب للشركات الصغيرة والمتوسطة.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n8. Checkout.com\r\n\r\nمناسبة لـ: السعودية، الإمارات، مصر.\r\n\r\nطرق الدفع:\r\n\r\nفيزا وماستركارد.\r\n\r\nالدفع عبر الهاتف المحمول.\r\n\r\nالدفع عند الاستلام.\r\n\r\n\r\nالمميزات:\r\n\r\nيتيح حلول دفع آمنة ومرنة.\r\n\r\nيقدم دعم شامل في منطقة الشرق الأوسط.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n9. STC Pay\r\n\r\nمناسبة لـ: السعودية.\r\n\r\nطرق الدفع:\r\n\r\nدفع عبر STC Pay.\r\n\r\nبطاقات الائتمان.\r\n\r\n\r\nالمميزات:\r\n\r\nحل قوي للدفع في المملكة العربية السعودية.\r\n\r\nدعم واسع من قبل شركات الاتصالات في السعودية.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n10. OPay\r\n\r\nمناسبة لـ: مصر، السعودية.\r\n\r\nطرق الدفع:\r\n\r\nفيزا وماستركارد.\r\n\r\nمحفظة OPay.\r\n\r\n\r\nالمميزات:\r\n\r\nخيار جيد في الدول العربية الكبرى.\r\n\r\nإمكانية دمج سهل مع المنصات التجارية.','2025-04-22 03:49:54','2025-07-19 07:22:26',1,0,1),(80,'Flat Todo Refrence','','1- ركب جرار الومنتال  وبيع الباب الالومنتال  وركب مطبخ المونتال\r\n\r\n2- ركب الكوبسات بتاعت الكهربا  وركب دوي ولمبات في الشقة كلها\r\n\r\n3- ركب سيفون للحمام وركب دوش \r\n\r\n4- ركب السرير الخشب لما عادل يجيلك ياخد مقاسات\r\n\r\n5- ركب حوض المطبخ وشيل الحوض القديم','2025-04-27 17:04:28','2025-07-13 05:58:06',1,0,1),(81,'htaccess','','React\r\n\r\n<IfModule mod_rewrite.c>\r\n\r\n  RewriteEngine On\r\n  RewriteBase /\r\n  RewriteRule ^index\\.html$ - [L]\r\n  RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f\r\n  RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d\r\n  RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-l\r\n  RewriteRule . /index.html [L]\r\n\r\n</IfModule>\r\n\r\nLaravel\r\n\r\n<IfModule mod_rewrite.c>\r\n    <IfModule mod_negotiation.c>\r\n        Options -MultiViews -Indexes\r\n    </IfModule>\r\n\r\n    RewriteEngine On\r\n\r\n    RewriteCond %{REQUEST_URI} !^/public/\r\n    RewriteRule ^(.*)$ /public/$1 [L,QSA]\r\n\r\n    # Handle Authorization Header\r\n    RewriteCond %{HTTP:Authorization} .\r\n    RewriteRule .* - [E=HTTP_AUTHORIZATION:%{HTTP:Authorization}]\r\n\r\n    # Redirect Trailing Slashes If Not A Folder...\r\n    RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d\r\n    RewriteCond %{REQUEST_URI} (.+)/$\r\n    RewriteRule ^ %1 [L,R=301]\r\n\r\n    # Send Requests To Front Controller...\r\n    RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d\r\n    RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f\r\n    RewriteRule ^ index.php [L]\r\n</IfModule>','2025-05-27 06:14:04','2025-09-09 23:42:10',1,0,1),(82,'ReactNative post','','import React, { useState } from \'react\';\r\nimport { View, TextInput, Button, Text, StyleSheet, Alert } from \'react-native\';\r\nimport axios from \'axios\';\r\n\r\nconst ContactUsScreen = () => {\r\n  const [formData, setFormData] = useState({ demo: \'\' });\r\n  const [errors, setErrors] = useState({ demo: \'\' });\r\n\r\n  const handleChange = (value) => {\r\n    setFormData({ demo: value });\r\n  };\r\n\r\n  const handleSubmit = async () => {\r\n    try {\r\n      await axios.post(\'https://yousab-tech.com/academy/public/api/message\', formData);\r\n      Alert.alert(\'Success\', \'Message sent successfully!\');\r\n      setFormData({ demo: \'\' });\r\n      setErrors({ demo: \'\' });\r\n    } catch (error) {\r\n      const apiErrors = error.response?.data?.data || {};\r\n      setErrors({\r\n        demo: apiErrors.demo ? apiErrors.demo.join(\'\\n\') : \'\',\r\n      });\r\n      Alert.alert(\'Error\', \'Failed to send message. Please check your input.\');\r\n    }\r\n  };\r\n\r\n  return (\r\n    <View style={styles.container}>\r\n      <TextInput\r\n        style={styles.input}\r\n        placeholder=\"Demo\"\r\n        value={formData.demo}\r\n        onChangeText={handleChange}\r\n      />\r\n      {errors.demo ? <Text style={styles.error}>{errors.demo}</Text> : null}\r\n\r\n      <Button title=\"Send Message\" onPress={handleSubmit} />\r\n    </View>\r\n  );\r\n};\r\n\r\nconst styles = StyleSheet.create({\r\n  container: { padding: 20 },\r\n  input: {\r\n    borderColor: \'#ccc\',\r\n    borderWidth: 1,\r\n    padding: 12,\r\n    marginBottom: 10,\r\n    borderRadius: 6,\r\n  },\r\n  error: { color: \'red\', marginBottom: 10 },\r\n});\r\n\r\nexport default ContactUsScreen;','2025-06-10 18:42:50','2025-07-13 05:58:06',1,0,1),(83,'ReactNative get','','import React, { useEffect, useState } from \'react\';\r\nimport { View, Text, Image, ScrollView, StyleSheet, ActivityIndicator, Alert } from \'react-native\';\r\n\r\nconst Courses = () => {\r\n  const [courses, setCourses] = useState([]);\r\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\r\n\r\n  useEffect(() => {\r\n    fetch(\'https://yousab-tech.com/academy/public/api/courses\')\r\n      .then((response) => response.json())\r\n      .then((data) => {\r\n        setCourses(data.data.courses);\r\n        setLoading(false);\r\n      })\r\n      .catch((error) => {\r\n        console.error(\'Error fetching courses:\', error);\r\n        Alert.alert(\'Error\', \'Failed to fetch courses.\');\r\n        setLoading(false);\r\n      });\r\n  }, []);\r\n\r\n  if (loading) {\r\n    return (\r\n      <View style={styles.loader}>\r\n        <ActivityIndicator size=\"large\" color=\"#007BFF\" />\r\n      </View>\r\n    );\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return (\r\n    <ScrollView contentContainerStyle={styles.container}>\r\n      <Text style={styles.heading}>Available Courses</Text>\r\n      {courses.map((item) => (\r\n        <View key={item.id} style={styles.card}>\r\n          <Image source={{ uri: item.image }} style={styles.image} />\r\n          <View style={styles.cardContent}>\r\n            <Text style={styles.title}>{item.title}</Text>\r\n            <Text numberOfLines={3} style={styles.description}>\r\n              {item.description.replace(/<\\/?[^>]+(>|$)/g, \'\')} {/* Remove HTML tags */}\r\n            </Text>\r\n            <Text style={styles.rating}>⭐ 4.5 (250 students)</Text>\r\n          </View>\r\n        </View>\r\n      ))}\r\n    </ScrollView>\r\n  );\r\n};\r\n\r\nconst styles = StyleSheet.create({\r\n  loader: {\r\n    flex: 1,\r\n    justifyContent: \'center\',\r\n    alignItems: \'center\',\r\n  },\r\n  container: {\r\n    padding: 16,\r\n  },\r\n  heading: {\r\n    fontSize: 24,\r\n    fontWeight: \'bold\',\r\n    textAlign: \'center\',\r\n    marginVertical: 20,\r\n  },\r\n  card: {\r\n    backgroundColor: \'#f0f0f0\',\r\n    borderRadius: 12,\r\n    overflow: \'hidden\',\r\n    marginBottom: 20,\r\n    elevation: 3,\r\n  },\r\n  image: {\r\n    width: \'100%\',\r\n    height: 180,\r\n  },\r\n  cardContent: {\r\n    padding: 12,\r\n  },\r\n  title: {\r\n    fontSize: 18,\r\n    fontWeight: \'600\',\r\n    marginBottom: 8,\r\n  },\r\n  description: {\r\n    fontSize: 14,\r\n    color: \'#333\',\r\n  },\r\n  rating: {\r\n    marginTop: 10,\r\n    fontWeight: \'bold\',\r\n    color: \'#007BFF\',\r\n  },\r\n});\r\n\r\nexport default Courses;','2025-06-10 18:43:00','2025-07-13 05:58:06',1,0,1),(84,'Freelance Dollars','','Powered by Etida  none egyption pound\n\nhttps://dfpp.eyouthlearning.com/login\nnessimboula@gmail.com\nstudent2025\n\r\nChalnges meet the clients \r\nD