,'2025-09-29 07:53:17',0,0,NULL,1),(17,'Overthinking, fearness, Sadness and Hard working are the dators that lead you to the banic attack \r\n. Avoid them please.','2025-09-29 08:18:11','2025-09-29 08:18:11',0,0,NULL,1),(18,'Our role as a software company is to create a website to client, add it on google search console and google analytics, create google campaign for him and help their business to succeed','2025-09-29 08:20:53','2025-09-29 08:20:53',0,0,NULL,1),(19,'In market there are many gigs, choose what fits you and avoid what headach you.','2025-09-29 08:23:46','2025-09-29 08:23:46',0,0,NULL,1),(20,'Add facebook and google marketting to yousabtech','2025-09-30 06:35:23','2025-09-30 06:35:23',0,0,NULL,1),(21,'The closing working hoyrs sustem is essential and must be always applied. It includes all work activites like apllying to jobs gettinv new gogs or any simular tasks','2025-10-02 00:13:33','2025-10-02 00:13:33',0,0,NULL,1),(22,'Make yousab app available by you only','2025-10-02 00:41:20','2025-10-02 00:41:20',0,0,NULL,1),(23,'Make lapmob work by drop shipping. In other words market products for shops that has delivery system to only afford marketting','2025-10-02 00:43:34','2025-10-02 00:43:34',0,0,NULL,1),(24,'If you are out of working hours use your whatsapp to record what you will do in working hours','2025-10-02 19:12:43','2025-10-02 19:12:43',0,0,NULL,1),(25,'Any time after washing your hand out eyedrops','2025-10-02 19:23:17','2025-10-02 19:23:17',0,0,NULL,1),(26,'Your work is programking and marketting s9 lapmob or any similar business is in the category of this even the programmibg courses these are one cycle','2025-10-02 19:24:17','2025-10-02 19:26:27',0,0,NULL,1),(27,'Programming and marketting are two firld complete abd empower eachothers','2025-10-02 19:27:48','2025-10-02 19:27:48',0,0,NULL,1),(28,'When sleeping leave mobile away of you','2025-10-02 19:28:59','2025-10-02 19:28:59',0,0,NULL,1),(29,'Your productivity in a limited selected timd us