ing who wants to who seals and both always available','2025-10-09 23:40:41','2025-10-09 23:40:41',0,0,NULL,1),(44,'If you want unstopable income, create a business that does not depend on your attendance','2025-10-09 23:41:45','2025-10-09 23:41:45',0,0,NULL,1),(45,'Always write what you todo today in lock screen to avoid being confused or stressed','2025-10-13 20:16:27','2025-10-13 20:16:27',0,0,NULL,1),(46,'Apply from mobile and followup from laptop when appkying to jobs or gigs','2025-10-14 22:23:46','2025-10-14 22:23:46',0,0,NULL,1),(48,'Use solofresh and corntears for your eyes together apply safty and wetness','2025-10-20 01:17:04','2025-10-20 01:17:04',0,0,NULL,1),(49,'Prepare your office and decorate it to be able to create marketting videos inside it and also buy a camera','2025-10-20 02:59:56','2025-10-20 02:59:56',0,0,NULL,1),(50,'Fell every moment you live because what passes never come again',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,1),(51,'Always take one of its type yo focus and succeed so in jop apps take wuzzuf in freelance take mostaql and try to reach premuim and do on as a big idea',NULL,'2025-10-29 17:11:12',1,1,NULL,1),(57,'When creating google ad to a client make sure to add a tracking code to know who opened the website','2025-10-29 18:04:37','2025-10-29 18:04:37',0,0,NULL,1),(58,'Best to get updated cv to visit word link of cv and open it with micorosoft word and send as pdf','2025-11-08 17:52:37','2025-12-07 03:05:08',0,0,NULL,1),(65,'The crowded progeamners in market is noylt a thread because they are not good to take gigs','2025-12-08 03:34:45','2025-12-08 03:34:45',0,0,NULL,1),(66,'Always update projects, deadlines and tasks data','2026-01-09 01:11:18','2026-01-09 01:11:33',0,0,NULL,1),(67,'Do not work on slow pc or laptop because tgis exust you make sure it is optimized and fast','2026-01-24 07:57:11','2026-01-24 07:57:11',0,0,NULL,1),(68,'Drink cofee midday or after work','2026-01-25 07:44:47','2026-01-25 07:44:47',0,0,NULL,1),(69,'Use latest i solutions lik