 and city </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">in /pharmacist link branch and customer group </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">add first option select </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">add debit limit as input in pharmacist</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">active should be optional </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">relation between admins and branches in sales </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">when creating pharmacist it doesnot store </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">add bank account to inputs in suppliers</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">make sku and rename it to barcode optional and in case of empty make it generated automatic</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">make images only one image </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">remove payment methods </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">when adding doctor remove pharmacy name </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">add customer group to sales filter </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">sales resp and admins in general does not save </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">remove role from pharmacist filter  and add customer group</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\">remove pharmacy from adding comission </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; b