></p><p style=\\\"line-height: 1.2;\\\"><font color=\\\"#ffffff\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px; text-align: justify; font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight);\\\">add trips in home background image that mina will send&nbsp;</span><br></font></p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><font color=\\\"#ffffff\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px; text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align); font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight);\\\">add logo to pdf</span><br></font></p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px;\\\"><font color=\\\"#ffffff\\\">remove background and make wave solid in wave&nbsp;</font></span></p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px;\\\">add booking email to confirm purchasing the trip&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\">contact toggle icon with adding more option(whatsapp phone messanger email )</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px;\\\"><br></span></p><p style=\\\"line-height: 1;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\"><font color=\\\"#ffffff\\\">move title in slider down or remove it4</font></span></p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px; background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\"><font color=\\\"#ffffff\\\">Search has been created, need to put it in header and going to create other modifications</font></span></p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><font color=\\\"#ffffff\\\" style=\\\"background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px;\\\">add review us besides show all reviews</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px;\\\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\"><font color=\\\"#ffffff\\\" style=\\\"background-color: rgb(57, 132, 198);\\\"><span style=