 one year to resolve any issues or inquiries.\\r\\n\\r\\nOrder Management: A comprehensive system for managing customer orders, including order tracking and status updates.\\r\\n\\r\\nEmail Order Confirmations: Automatic email confirmations for customers after placing an order.\\r\\n\\r\\nOnline Payment Integration: Secure online payment methods to facilitate easy and safe transactions.\\r\\n\\r\\nWebsite Contents\\r\\n\\r\\nHome Page: Contains an introduction to the company, latest news, and special product offers.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"About Us\\\" Page: Detailed information about the company\\\'s history, mission, and goals.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"Contact Us\\\" Page: A simple contact form for visitors to send emails directly to the company, along with complete contact information.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"Products\\\" Page: Comprehensive information about the different medicines and products offered by the company, with the option to purchase online.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"Services\\\" Page: A showcase of all the services available, including distribution, consultations, and more.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\\"Cart and Orders\\\" Page: A dedicated page for customers to view their shopping cart, manage their orders, and track order statuses.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe are committed to providing a website that reflects the professionalism of the medicines company and offers an excellent user experience. Our goal is to support you with the best tools to manage and enhance your online presence, with a focus on seamless e-commerce integration.\', `created_at` = \'2024-07-17 00:32:08\', `id` = \'8\', `isOverthinking` = \'0\', `script` = \'\', `title` = \'Offers\', `updated_at` = \'2025-07-13 05:58:06\'\r\n                WHERE id = 8;\r\n            \r\n','2025-07-13 19:05:39','2025-07-13 19:05:39',1,0),(802,NULL,'\r\n                UPDATE yousabte_workspace.issues\r\n                SET `codeLinks` = \'72000 02/06/2025\', `created_at` = \'2024-07-17 00:33:46\', `id` = \'9\', `isOverthinking` = \'0\', `script` = \'\', `title` 